    "Went out woodcock-",
    "shooting, tramping",
    "about twenty",
    "five miles through",
    "awful places, for",
    "the cock are",
    "only now found",
    "in very thick",
    "cover. I shot",
    "wretchedly, mis-",
    "-sing over half",
    "my birds. As the",
    "day was pretty",
    "hot both I and",
    "the dog are",
    "pretty well done",
    "up."
